{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25002","headline":"陈使君山庄 · 牟融","name":"陈使君山庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新卜幽居地自偏，士林争羡使君贤。\n数椽潇洒临溪屋，十亩膏腴附郭田。\n流水断桥芳草路，淡烟疎雨落花天。\n秋成准拟重来此，沈醉何妨一榻眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}